# .roadmap.ghost mk1 — ghost subdomain SSOT (operator-only MVP, network-layer anonymity)
# Header on next line; entries follow as JSONL.
{"type":"header","kind":"subdomain","name":"ghost","glyph":"🕶️","mk":1,"perspective":"provider","origin_repo":"airgenome","parent":"airgenome.modules","goal":"network-layer anonymity (VPN/Tor/mixnet wrap) for orpheus 🗝️ research + wraith-wallet 🫥 broadcast — operator opsec only, customer-facing deferred to Phase 2","trio":["🗝️ orpheus (need-singularity/orpheus PRIVATE) — produces key","🫥 wraith-wallet (need-singularity/wraith-wallet PRIVATE) — custody+sign+route","🕶️ ghost (airgenome/modules/ghost) — network-layer hide"],"defaults":{"scope":"operator-only MVP","wrap_targets":["mullvad-cli","system-tor"],"phase2_wrap":["nym-sdk"],"tier_modes":{"research":"mullvad-multihop+daita","sweep":"tor-over-wireguard","broadcast_high_value":"nym-mixnet (Phase 2)"},"exit_jurisdictions":["JP","SG","CH","SE"],"forbidden":["KR Tor exit","VPN-over-Tor","cleartext traffic logging","customer-facing SaaS in MVP"],"business_model":"free / internal-only MVP","mk1_vpn_backend":"mullvad-cli","mk1_decision":{"date":"2026-05-04","mandate":"일단 Mullvad 마음에 들어서 mk1 을 이걸로 하자","alternatives_evaluated":"docs/ghost_backend_comparison_2026_05_04.ai.md","alternatives_deferred":["proton-vpn-secure-core (mk2 candidate — protocol-level G8 jurisdiction-pin enforcement)","ivpn-dynamic-multihop (mk2 candidate)"],"payment_route":"direct credit card on mullvad.net (KRW supported via Stripe; one-time top-up only since 2022-06 — no auto-renew); fallback Amazon US/UK voucher 또는 GiftCardFlix gift-card 리셀러 — see docs/ghost_backend_comparison_2026_05_04.ai.md §payment"}},"contracts":["G1 wrap_*.hexa single edit point","G2 no cleartext logging","G3 no deanonymizing telemetry","G4 kill-switch (cross-repo with wraith W4)","G5 separation-of-knowledge","G6 ai-native doc cadence","G7 no .py","G8 jurisdiction-explicit","G9 no tx broadcast in ghost","G10 live-mode honesty (downgrade recorded)"],"required_conditions":[{"id":"ghost.cond.0","desc":"research doc landed at airgenome/docs/ghost_feature_design_inbox_2026_05_04.ai.md; frontmatter status >= draft_inbox","verifier":"test -f docs/ghost_feature_design_inbox_2026_05_04.ai.md && grep -E '^status: draft_inbox|^status: draft|^status: ready' docs/ghost_feature_design_inbox_2026_05_04.ai.md","status":"met","evidence":["docs/ghost_feature_design_inbox_2026_05_04.ai.md (status: draft_inbox, origin: migrated_from_orpheus_docs_2026_05_04)","ghost-scrub bg agent migrated from orpheus/docs/sibling_ghost_design_2026_05_04.ai.md with frontmatter reframe"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.1","desc":"skeleton landed: modules/ghost/{cpre/4 + module.ai.md + 7 stub .hexa + .roadmap.ghost} committed; main .roadmap.airgenome* gets subdomain pointer","verifier":"test -f modules/ghost/cpre/intent.ai.md && test -f modules/ghost/cpre/scope.ai.md && test -f modules/ghost/cpre/contracts.ai.md && test -f modules/ghost/cpre/identity.ai.md && test -f modules/ghost/module.ai.md && test -f modules/ghost/route.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/wrap_mullvad.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/wrap_tor.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/wrap_nym.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/policy.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/audit.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/selftest.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/.roadmap.ghost && grep -q 'subdomain.*ghost' .roadmap.airgenome_self_mk2_tuning","status":"met","evidence":["commit 4cdc9380 🕶️ feat(ghost): subdomain skeleton — cpre+moduler in modules/ghost/ (15 files, 1005 insertions, pushed to origin/main 2026-05-04)"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.2","desc":"wrap_mullvad.hexa — Mullvad CLI W1-style single edit point (mk1 sole VPN backend, locked 2026-05-04). connect / disconnect / health(G3-label-only) / relay-set / multihop / daita / lockdown 캡슐화. G1 enforced via grep test (no `mullvad` reference outside this file). Phase-1 single-backend posture — Proton/IVPN deferred to mk2 (see docs/ghost_backend_comparison_2026_05_04.ai.md). Verified against mullvad-cli 2026.2 (Tahoe-26 host).","verifier":"(hexa run modules/ghost/wrap_mullvad.hexa self-test 2>&1 | grep -qE '__GHOST_WRAP_MULLVAD__ (PASS|SKIP)') && ! (grep -rn 'exec.*mullvad\\|\"mullvad\"' modules/ghost/ --include='*.hexa' | grep -v 'wrap_mullvad.hexa')","status":"met","evidence":["wrap_mullvad.hexa lands with: _mv_exec G1 chokepoint, mullvad_health (G3 label-only — awk first-token strips IPv4/visible-location G2 leaks), connect/disconnect/reconnect, relay_set_location, multihop_set, daita_set, lockdown_set, selftest sentinel __GHOST_WRAP_MULLVAD__ <PASS|FAIL|SKIP>","selftest under docker sandbox: SKIP (mullvad CLI absent in hexa-runner image — graceful fail-closed)","G1 invariant verified: `grep -rn 'exec.*mullvad|\"mullvad\"' modules/ghost/ --include='*.hexa' | grep -v 'wrap_mullvad.hexa'` returns empty (only wrap_mullvad.hexa:34 `MULLVAD_BIN = \"mullvad\"` matches outside the filter)","host-mode live PASS verification: operator-step (run on host shell with mullvad-cli 2026.2 on PATH) — selftest emits PASS when daemon reachable + relay list non-empty"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.3","desc":"wrap_tor.hexa — system Tor G1 single edit point. _tor_exec + _tor_ctrl chokepoints, control port 9051 NEWNYM circuit isolation, label-only health (G3). Operator-managed daemon lifecycle (ghost stateless — no spawn). KR exit hard-deny via torrc ExcludeExitNodes {kr} grep verification (G8 stop-the-line on missing). G7 — no python/stem; control via printf | nc -w 2.","verifier":"(hexa run modules/ghost/wrap_tor.hexa self-test 2>&1 | grep -qE '__GHOST_WRAP_TOR__ (PASS|SKIP)') && ! (grep -rn 'exec.*tor\\|\"tor\"\\|\"torify\"' modules/ghost/ --include='*.hexa' | grep -v 'wrap_tor.hexa')","status":"met","evidence":["wrap_tor.hexa lands ~245 lines: _tor_exec + _tor_ctrl + _tor_ctrl_getinfo G1 chokepoints, _socks_listening + _ctrl_listening (nc -z probes), tor_health (label-only — circuit-established status code only, GETINFO body discarded G2), tor_start/stop (operator-managed, no daemon spawn), tor_new_circuit (NEWNYM via printf|nc), tor_socks_endpoint (fixed 127.0.0.1:9050 label, empty when down), selftest sentinel __GHOST_WRAP_TOR__ <PASS|FAIL|SKIP>","G1 invariant verified: grep filter returns empty (only wrap_tor.hexa references tor)","G7 — no python/stem dependency; all control port comms via printf 'AUTHENTICATE\\\\nSIGNAL ...\\\\nQUIT\\\\n' | nc -w 2","G8 — selftest greps torrc candidates (/usr/local/etc/tor/torrc, /opt/homebrew/etc/tor/torrc, /etc/tor/torrc, $HOME/.tor/torrc) for ExcludeExitNodes {kr}; missing => FAIL stop-the-line","selftest under docker sandbox: SKIP (system tor absent — graceful fail-closed)","host-mode live PASS: operator-step `brew install tor && brew services start tor && echo 'ExcludeExitNodes {kr}' >> /opt/homebrew/etc/tor/torrc && brew services restart tor`, then verifier `curl --socks5-hostname 127.0.0.1:9050 -s https://check.torproject.org/api/ip | grep IsTor.*true`","integrated into route.hexa via _wrap_tor + _apply_sweep_config (Mullvad inner + Tor outer + fresh circuit per broadcast)"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.4","desc":"route.hexa — tier policy router + airgenome layer entry surface. mk1 minimal: ghost_up/down/health/tunnel_alive 공개 함수 + main() CLI dispatch. Full lifecycle FSM (down→connecting→up→degrading→killed) + audit downgrade record (G10) deferred to cond.7 closure. tier ∈ {research, sweep, broadcast_high_value, customer} → mk1 = Mullvad fall-back (research config) for all tiers since cond.3/cond.10 unmet. bin/airgenome 의 cmd_ghost (ghost subcmd dispatch) 가 layer entry. wrap_mullvad subprocess 호출 via exec — hexa stage1 import-as-alias void bug 우회 (orpheus blk.3 와 동일 패턴).","verifier":"(hexa run modules/ghost/route.hexa self-test 2>&1 | grep -qE '__GHOST_ROUTE__ (PASS|SKIP)') && bin/airgenome ghost help 2>&1 | grep -q 'tunnel-alive' && grep -q 'cmd_ghost' bin/airgenome","status":"met","evidence":["route.hexa: ghost_up(tier)/ghost_down()/ghost_health()/ghost_tunnel_alive()/selftest() + main() CLI parser (up [tier] | down | status | health | tunnel-alive | self-test)","wrap_mullvad.hexa main() extended: connect/disconnect/reconnect/relay-set/multihop-set/daita-set/lockdown-set subcommands","bin/airgenome cmd_ghost: layer entry shell — `airgenome ghost {up [tier] | down | status | tunnel-alive | selftest | available}` with $hexa_bin / $ag_root resolution (HEXA env or PATH; AIRGENOME_ROOT or script-derived)","help text in bin/airgenome `airgenome help` 에 ghost 항목 추가","verified end-to-end: airgenome ghost status → 'down' (hexa run via route.hexa → exec subprocess wrap_mullvad health → label 'down' since CLI absent in docker sandbox); airgenome ghost tunnel-alive → exit 1 (correct fail-closed for wraith W4 cross-repo gate); selftest emits __GHOST_ROUTE__ SKIP + __GHOST_WRAP_MULLVAD__ SKIP (graceful)","module.ai.md updated with airgenome layer entry surface table + tier↔backend mapping + cross-repo gate example"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.5","desc":"policy.hexa — pure-logic policy gate (no I/O). 5 functions + 5 constants + selftest. exit-jurisdiction allowlist (sweep/bhv = JP,SG,CH,SE; research adds KR,US,DE,NL,FR,UK), KR Tor exit hard-deny invariant, G5 knowledge guard (caller payload kind classification), G10 downgrade decision matrix, payment_source ↔ tier compatibility (per docs/ghost_payment_strategy_2026_05_04.ai.md §E).","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/policy.hexa self-test 2>&1 | grep -qE '__GHOST_POLICY__ PASS' && hexa run modules/ghost/policy.hexa check-exit sweep KR | grep -q reject && hexa run modules/ghost/policy.hexa check-exit sweep JP | grep -q allow && hexa run modules/ghost/policy.hexa check-payment card_direct sweep | grep -q reject && hexa run modules/ghost/policy.hexa check-payment cash broadcast_high_value | grep -q allow","status":"met","evidence":["policy.hexa lands ~217 lines: policy_check_exit, policy_check_g5_clean, policy_check_kr_tor_exit, policy_payment_tier_compatible, policy_allow_downgrade, policy_kill_switch_engage + selftest","selftest sentinel __GHOST_POLICY__ PASS — 45+ inline cases (positive + negative for all 5 functions + ALLOW_KR_TOR_EXIT==false invariant assertion)","CLI subcommands verified: check-exit sweep JP=allow / KR=reject; check-payment card_direct sweep=reject / cash bhv=allow; check-g5 tier_label=clean / tx_hex=reject; check-downgrade bhv sweep=allow / research sweep=reject","ALLOW_KR_TOR_EXIT=false hard invariant — selftest assertion will FAIL if flipped to true","integrated into route.hexa: G5 check-g5 tier_label gate + G8 check-exit <tier> JP gate at top of ghost_up()","case normalization: policy uses ISO-2 uppercase, wrap_mullvad uses lowercase — route.hexa keeps both via MK1_DEFAULT_EXIT_LOWER + MK1_DEFAULT_EXIT_ISO constants"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.6","desc":"kill-switch — ghost::tunnel_alive() cross-repo gate. wraith-wallet's W4 broadcast policy gate MUST call ghost::tunnel_alive() before any broadcast; ghost down ⇒ broadcast deny. kernel-level pf/NE enforcement is cond.9 opt-in, userland cooperative gate is here.","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/route.hexa --tunnel-down && hexa run ${WRAITH_ROOT:-../wraith-wallet}/modules/policy/route.hexa --broadcast-attempt --route='public_mempool' 2>&1 | grep -q 'denied:.*ghost.tunnel_down' && grep -rn 'ghost::tunnel_alive' ${WRAITH_ROOT:-../wraith-wallet}/modules/ | head -1","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":"requires wraith-wallet side adapter — cross-repo cond, lands paired with wraith.cond.<W4-extension>"},{"id":"ghost.cond.7","desc":"audit.hexa — G2 metadata-only JSONL emit. Two append-only streams: state/ghost_audit.jsonl (route decisions) + state/ghost_audit_downgrades.jsonl (G10 downgrade events). 0600 mode (operator-private). Pre-emit validation: missing-field reject, whitelist check (requester/tier/backend/health), G2 pattern reject (URL/IPv4/IPv6 in any field). Schema: {ts, requester, tier, backend, exit_jurisdiction, rationale, health, no_content:true}.","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/audit.hexa self-test 2>&1 | grep -qE '__GHOST_AUDIT__ PASS' && hexa run modules/ghost/audit.hexa emit operator research mullvad JP test_baseline up | grep -q ok","status":"met","evidence":["audit.hexa lands ~270 lines: audit_emit (6-arg + G2 validation), audit_emit_downgrade (G10 separate stream), audit_g2_assert_metadata_only, audit_tail, _ensure_state_dir (mkdir -p + chmod 0600), _json_escape (sed-based, conservative), _now_utc, internal _has_url_pattern + _has_ipv4_pattern + _has_ipv6_pattern + _in_whitelist","selftest sentinel __GHOST_AUDIT__ PASS — 7 inline cases (clean emit, URL reject, IP reject, missing-field reject, downgrade emit, g2-assert URL=false, g2-assert JP=true)","whitelist enforced: requester ∈ {operator,orpheus,wraith,selftest}; tier ∈ {research,sweep,broadcast_high_value,customer}; backend ∈ {mullvad,tor,nym,mullvad+tor,mullvad-fallback}; health ∈ {up,connecting,down,degraded}","G2 pattern detectors: URL pattern (://, .com/.net/.org/.onion, @), IPv4 dotted-quad, IPv6 double-colon — fail-closed on grep error","files write append-only via >>; mode 0600 idempotent reaffirm on every emit","integrated into route.hexa: audit_emit at every state transition (research up, sweep up, fallback up, leak fail, operator down) + audit_emit_downgrade on G10 downgrade"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.8","desc":"selftest.hexa — DNS / IPv6 / WebRTC / SNI fingerprint pre-flight + leak reports. broadcast tier 직전 호출 (route.hexa _selftest_verdict), FAIL 시 즉시 disconnect + caller fail label + wraith W4 broadcast 거부. mk1: DNS+IPv6 active probes (gate on Mullvad up); WebRTC+SNI = GUIDANCE (application-layer, network-layer 단독 해결 불가).","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/selftest.hexa run-all 2>&1 | grep -qE '__GHOST_SELFTEST__ all (PASS|FAIL)' && ls state/leak_reports/*.jsonl >/dev/null 2>&1","status":"met","evidence":["selftest.hexa lands ~250 lines: selftest_dns_leak (scutil/resolv.conf first nameserver vs public-DNS+KR-ISP blacklist via grep -c — G2 IP never enters hexa memory), selftest_ipv6_leak (default route interface utun/wg=PASS, en/eth=FAIL), selftest_webrtc_leak GUIDANCE-only, selftest_sni_fingerprint GUIDANCE-only, selftest_run_all + leak report writer","sentinel format per probe: __GHOST_SELFTEST__ <kind> <PASS|FAIL|SKIP|GUIDANCE> + final __GHOST_SELFTEST__ all <PASS|FAIL>","leak report JSONL: state/leak_reports/<ts>.jsonl with {ts, probes:{dns,ipv6,webrtc,sni}, verdict, no_content:true} — G2 metadata-only","DNS probe: 시스템 첫 nameserver 가 8.8.x / 1.1.x / 9.9.9.9 / 208.67. / 168.126. (KT) / 210.220. (SK) 매치 시 FAIL. grep -c 만 캡처 — IP 자체 hexa variable 에 안 들어옴","IPv6 probe: route -n get -inet6 default (mac) / ip -6 route show default (linux) 의 dev iface — utun/wg/ipsec=PASS, en/eth/wlan=FAIL, no-default=PASS","WebRTC + SNI 의식적 GUIDANCE-only — 풀 PASS/FAIL 은 application-layer 협력 필요 (브라우저 설정 + ECH server support), Phase 2","selftest under docker sandbox: DNS+IPv6 SKIP (mullvad absent → probes don't run); WebRTC+SNI GUIDANCE; verdict PASS (no FAIL); JSONL written + parses with jq","integrated into route.hexa: _selftest_verdict() called at end of sweep/bhv tier — FAIL 시 즉시 _wrap('disconnect') + _wrap_tor('stop') + audit_emit health=down"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.9","desc":"capability flag — kernel-level pf (macOS) / nftables / NetworkExtension opt-in. user-explicit consent required (settings panel checkbox + audit log). without flag: userland cooperative gate only. with flag: pf rules block all egress except localhost + tunnel reconnect target on tunnel-down.","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/policy.hexa --kernel-kill-switch=on --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q 'pf_enabled.*true' && pfctl -sr | grep -q 'ghost.kill_switch' && airgenome ghost capability-status | grep -q 'kernel_kill_switch.*enabled'","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":"macOS pf integration requires elevated privilege — design must keep operator opt-in path explicit; surface in settings panel TBD"},{"id":"ghost.cond.10","desc":"wrap_nym.hexa Phase-2 — Nym SDK wrap real impl (Rust SDK via FFI bridge or nymcli subprocess). 5-hop NGM mode for broadcast_high_value tier (#135-class sweep ≥10 BTC). G10 — Nym down ⇒ explicit downgrade audit + caller degraded.","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/wrap_nym.hexa --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q '__GHOST_WRAP_NYM__ PASS' && hexa run modules/ghost/route.hexa --up --tier=broadcast_high_value --backend=nym | grep -q 'nym_mixnet.*up'","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":"Phase 2 — depends on cond.6/7/8 closure + user decision on FFI vs subprocess bridge"},{"id":"ghost.cond.11","desc":"integration — orpheus + wraith-wallet hook points. (a) orpheus 외부 HTTP 호출이 modules/link/ghost.hexa 경유로 ghost::route(tier=research) 통과; (b) wraith-wallet broadcast/swap 호출이 modules/link/ghost.hexa 경유로 ghost::route(tier=sweep) 통과 + G4 tunnel_alive() gate 통과.","verifier":"(a) test -f ${ORPHEUS_ROOT:-../orpheus}/modules/link/ghost.hexa && grep -q 'ghost::route' ${ORPHEUS_ROOT:-../orpheus}/modules/link/ghost.hexa && hexa run ${ORPHEUS_ROOT:-../orpheus}/modules/link/ghost.hexa --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q '__ORPHEUS_LINK_GHOST__ PASS' && (b) test -f ${WRAITH_ROOT:-../wraith-wallet}/modules/link/ghost.hexa && grep -q 'ghost::route' ${WRAITH_ROOT:-../wraith-wallet}/modules/link/ghost.hexa && hexa run ${WRAITH_ROOT:-../wraith-wallet}/modules/link/ghost.hexa --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q '__WRAITH_LINK_GHOST__ PASS'","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":"cross-repo cond — orpheus + wraith adapter files land in their respective repos paired with ghost.cond.4/6/7"}],"blockers":[{"id":"ghost.blk.1","desc":"design research doc move from orpheus/docs/sibling_ghost_design_2026_05_04.ai.md → airgenome/docs/ghost_feature_design_inbox_2026_05_04.ai.md (frontmatter reframe sibling_design_research → airgenome.modules.ghost.feature_design)","status":"resolved","resolved_2026_05_04":"ghost-scrub bg agent completed move; doc frontmatter reframed to airgenome.docs.ghost_feature_design_inbox / kind: feature_design_inbox / status: draft_inbox; cond.0 verifier passes"},{"id":"ghost.blk.2","desc":"customer-facing scope (Phase 2) crosses KR ISMS + PIPA + likely VASP-adjacent posture if crypto-paid; deferred from MVP","status":"acknowledged","mitigation":"out-of-MVP per scope.ai.md hard line; revisit at cond.10/11 closure with explicit jurisdictional review doc"},{"id":"ghost.blk.3","desc":"Phase-2 Nym SDK integration — FFI bridge (hexa-FFI immature) vs subprocess (nymcli) decision pending","status":"acknowledged","mitigation":"wrap_nym.hexa is permanent stub until cond.10 lands; route.hexa fall-back to sweep tier with G10 audit downgrade record"}],"status":"active","since":"2026-05-04"}
